&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of production level experience in one of: Python, Java, Scala, C++, or similar language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; developing &lt;strong&gt;large-scale distributed system&lt;/strong&gt;s from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
