&lt;li&gt;Build Databricks&#39; brand in India in partnership with the Marketing and Sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring the experience, priorities, and takeaways of the field engineering team to the planning and strategy roadmap of the organisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
