&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;building platforms, infrastructure,&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;database engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, especially with &lt;strong&gt;MySQL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;TiDB&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
