&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience providing technical leadership on planet-scale production data systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading architecture efforts for performance-sensitive systems (e.g., latency-critical services, multi-tenant platforms, large-scale indexing pipelines).&lt;/li&gt;
