&lt;li&gt;10+ years experience developing search relevance systems at scale in production or in high-impact research environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying LLM to search relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one or more of the following:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NLP&lt;/li&gt;
